   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Folks,<div><br></div><div>Sorry for the late notice, but we will be having our regular work group today from 12-2 in 360 Shields Library (DSI Workspace). </div><div><br></div><div>Taylor Reiter will be giving a talk on Reproducible Examples (REPREX) for the first portion of the work group: </div><div><br></div><div>&quot;Given the many questions that get posed on our list-serv, as well as on StackOverflow or other discussion boards, it seemed a good time to have a short talk on what a <a href=\"https://reprex.tidyverse.org/articles/reprex-dos-and-donts.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://reprex.tidyverse.org/articles/reprex-dos-and-donts.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466182800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw26_BRKygqI0rYGW4Cwwqk2\">reprex</a> consists of, how to quickly generate a reprex, and why reprex are really key for getting questions answered.&quot; </div><div><br></div><div>This should be a really useful talk! Hope to see you there!</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div>Martha <br><div><br></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\">Martha Wohlfeil<div><br></div><div>Graduate Group in Ecology</div><div>Avian Ecology Lab, PhD Candidate</div><div>Wickson Hall 3017</div><div>University of California, Davis </div><div><a href=\"http://marthawohlfeil.github.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://marthawohlfeil.github.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792466182800000&amp;usg=AOvVaw06rHnEG-26iuWyAPY_ZqpL\">marthawohlfeil.github.io</a></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\r\n"
    ]
   ]
  },
